We are thrilled to announce that Dr. Chanyang Min has joined the Ajou Health Data Science Lab as a Research Instructor, effective April 1, 2026.
As an expert in nutrition and health data analytics, Dr. Min brings extensive experience in analyzing national health insurance claims data and the Korea National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey (KNHANES). Moving forward, Dr. Min will play a key role in generating robust medical evidence through extensive collaborative research with various clinical departments. Please join us in welcoming Dr. Min to the team! 🎉

